	(text "D11 10V zener clamps Q1 Vgs\n(AO3401A Vgs abs max +/-12V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.87 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2de1161a-e341-4882-b2a4-2c7d98829719")
	)
	(text "PR1 divider R3/R4\n100k/68k -> 2.47V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a803a1e-00f1-43ca-aaf3-da80371dba7e")
	)
	(text "J1 POWERBOARD CONNECTOR - JST-XH 8P\n  1-2 +5V   3-4 +3V3   5-6 GND   7 PWR_UART_TX   8 PWR_UART_RX\n  UART4 115200 (PA0/PA1), 3.3V, R46/R47 1k series. Pin 7/8 order to confirm with powerboard.\n5V:  Q1 reverse polarity -> D9 TVS -> U8 TPS259631 eFuse -> +5V_PB\n3V3: D10 TVS -> U9 TPS259631 eFuse -> +3V3_PB  (no series FET, saves ~0.15V at 1.5A)\neFuse (TI SLVSET8A): OVLO and UVLO trip at 1.2V on the pin, ILIM = 909/RILM, 22nF dVdt = 2V/ms.\n  U8: OVLO 5.60V, UVLO 4.29V, ILIM 1.5A      U9: OVLO 3.66V, UVLO 2.80V, ILIM 2.0A\n  FLT wired-OR with R52 pull-up -> PWR_FAULT (PA4). TPS259631 = auto-retry.\nQ1: D = input, S = load, G to GND via R43. D11 10V zener clamps Vgs (AO3401A abs max +/-12V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 279.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4b1552b3-3242-4a29-b6dd-2625ec5fa8e0")
	)
	(text "ROUTING - POWER INPUT\nJ1 -> Q1/D9/D10 -> U8/U9 -> U1/U2: 2A traces, >=1.0mm on 1oz outer (or pours).\nU8/U9 thermal pad to a GND pour with vias. R51/R56 right at the ILM pins.\nD9/D10 right at the rail, short wide GND via. C1/C2/C7 at TPS2116 VIN, C3/C8 at VOUT.\nU3 tab to a copper pour. R46/R47 near J1, UART pair away from the power pours."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
				(color 255 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4eb9f006-ad9e-464c-9bec-1c277fd5ecb2")
	)
	(text "5V FROM POWERBOARD   J1 pins 1-2 -> Q1 reverse polarity -> D9 TVS -> U8 eFuse (UV/OV/ILIM) -> U1 mux VIN1 -> +5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.508)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "58a044e4-0f08-45db-bf49-ff7a2e999128")
	)
	(text "POWER MUX - U1/U2 TPS2116, priority mode (MODE = VIN1)\nVIN1 = powerboard (after eFuse), VIN2 = USB side. VREF 0.92 / 1.00 / 1.08V, no built-in hysteresis.\n  U1 5V:   R1/R2 100k/33k + R58 1M from ST  -> ~3.80V falling / 4.13V rising\n  U2 3V3:  R3/R4 100k/68k + R60 1M from ST  -> ~2.24V falling / 2.57V rising\n  While VIN1 is selected it is tied to VOUT, so when the powerboard drops out the rail\n  sags to the PR1 falling threshold before VIN2 takes over (DESIGN_AUDIT M8).\nST is open-drain (R57/R59 pull-ups): PWR_SRC_5V -> PA2, PWR_SRC_3V3 -> PA3. High = powerboard.\nR45 100k holds VBUS_SW at 0V while U13 is off (50uA).\nU3 AP7361C-33E: 1A LDO, 360mV dropout. USB-only is bench use: U13 ILIM ~0.5A, F1 500mA PTC.\nFirmware keeps the radio and DotStars off when ST is low; nothing does in DFU (DESIGN_AUDIT M9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 279.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b3fd637-c138-42b5-ad28-93c53528caaa")
	)
	(text "PR1 divider R1/R2\n100k/33k -> 4.03V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8d724972-cd1f-4d41-bcfd-d0ef49960dcd")
	)
	(text "U13 USB VBUS SURGE LIMIT (TPS259631)\nUSB 2.0 7.2.4.1: max 10uF on VBUS incl. caps visible through regulators;\n~152uF is downstream of VBUS_SW. dVdt 47nF -> 0.94V/ms, ~0.14A inrush.\nOVLO 5.61V, UVLO 4.01V (device min 4.40V), ILIM ~0.5A, FLT -> PWR_FAULT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.57 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd3eeadc-b0b8-444f-991e-eadf5aaa7964")
	)
	(text "3V3 FROM POWERBOARD   J1 pins 3-4 -> D10 TVS -> U9 eFuse (UV/OV/ILIM) -> U2 mux VIN1 -> +3V3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.508)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c833aff3-87a0-4d55-851d-7c534a915f93")
	)
	(text "R45 = VBUS_SW bleeder:\nholds VIN2 at 0V with no\nUSB cable inserted"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e867d50c-8d12-428b-bc4d-236c384b2678")
	)
	(text "USB VBUS (J2, sheet 03)   U13 eFuse -> VBUS_SW -> U1 VIN2 (+5V backup) and U3 LDO -> +3V3_LDO -> U2 VIN2 (+3V3 backup)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 199.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.508)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eca4a877-365d-4c91-a2e9-9b81dd623ac3")
	)
	(text "LIMITS (TPS2596 SLVSET8A 7.5: OVLO 1.17-1.22V rising, 1.08-1.13V falling)\n1. U9 OVLO trips at 3.57-3.72V and re-enables only below 3.29-3.45V.\n   U8 OVLO trips at 5.46-5.69V and re-enables only below 5.04-5.27V.\n   After one overshoot a rail can stay off at a normal supply voltage (DESIGN_AUDIT M7).\n2. TPS2596 ILIM max is 2.0A. A 3V3 budget above ~1.8A needs a higher-current eFuse.\n3. D9/D10 are surge/ESD only (D9 VBR 7.5V; D10 part not confirmed). OVLO does the cut-off.\n4. 3V3 drop at 1.5A: U9 ~0.15-0.21V + U2 ~0.08V. Powerboard 3V3 >= 3.4V (radio min 3.0V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f31dfeee-ac69-4150-8123-051de5786452")
	)
